# #5866 B2 (a5e2e2ef, #5866 comments 6667971108 and 6668005024): the donor's bound on a
# sibling's marker resolves only on a witness of that sibling's own link (LinkedGeneration,
# written after its link's raise succeeded), never on a raise of the shard's routing generation,
# which L1 makes for any link in the shard (HandOffMarkerCore.CollectPendingDonorBounds).
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestBoundResolvesOnAnyRaise
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
PERTURBS: OtherLinkRaise
SUMMARY: another split's link raises the shard's generation and L's pending donor bound reads as resolved before L's own link, so L stops carrying the close and free-advances past a stale donor's routed write outside every bound it reads
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithLatch = TRUE, WithOtherLinkRaise = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ gD' = gD + 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<gL, pend, pendGen, moved, otherMoved, dUsed, reclaims, strayReclaims, cGen, lw>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the bound reads as resolved once any link raises the shard's generation.
    /\ gD' = gD + 1
    /\ lw' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<gL, pend, pendGen, moved, otherMoved, dUsed, reclaims, strayReclaims, cGen>>
--- END
